        // https://www.tradingview.com/script/nZuBWW9j-Jurik-Moving-Average/
    // NomandandTrader, SuperTrend ATR + RSI
        // https://www.tradingview.com/script/jG2gBNQK-SuperTrend-ATR-RSI/
        
